      "content": "i know, but it's just... it's exhausting. people keep telling me it gets better or that he's in a better place, but it doesn't change the fact that my life is just this silent, miserable loop now. it feels like the only thing that actually mattered is gone, and the rest of this is just noise. it feels almost stupid to keep trying to find meaning in it all.",
